<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls to 6.26 pct on 3-mo Italy BOTs.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls to 6.26 pct on 3-mo Italy BOTs.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 14.0 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.26	(6.74)    98.48	  (98.40)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.52	(6.63)    96.87	  (96.80)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.50	(6.55)    93.90	  (93.85)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on December 23.</p>
</text>
